        "description": "Identifies processes started from binaries whose SHA-256 hash matches a Chalk Trellis cryptominer sample, as reported in campaign PTF-02116. The indicators are synthetic and use reserved address and domain ranges, so they match no real traffic.",
        "false_positives": [
            "Security testing that replays known indicators.",
            "A shared hosting address or domain that later served benign content."
        ],
        "from": "now-9m",
        "index": [
            "logs-endpoint.events.process-*"
        ],
        "language": "eql",
        "license": "Elastic License v2",
        "name": "Chalk Trellis Cryptominer: Process started from known malicious binary (PTF-02116)",
        "note": "## Triage and analysis\n\n### Investigating Chalk Trellis Cryptominer: Process started from known malicious binary\n\nThis rule matches indicators that the Partner Threat Feed attributes to the Chalk Trellis cryptominer in campaign PTF-02116.\n\n### Possible investigation steps\n\n- Review the matching event and the host or user it came from.\n- Look for other indicators from the same campaign on the same host.\n- Check the process tree around the event for the initial execution or delivery.\n\n### Response and remediation\n\n- Isolate the host if the match is confirmed.\n- Block the indicators at the network edge and on endpoints.\n- Reset credentials used on the host.\n",
        "query": "process where event.type == \"start\" and process.hash.sha256 in (\"51379d8ff6be2d6398f3f36e5d9383584bc1e64853e7cb0c4efbabb0d1df1f2a\", \"5187e0a81152abc1563ec3d8375a3de0ecdbb512a792253e165b8c42b740126f\", \"4286ca51ed6ae463e038528fd02445fa6fd1df95e7b2a85437d96eb2656752e9\", \"327867ba04a99769da9b56032ec9ea07163dec6aebf0219e9782c8dd28ecd482\", \"d4a81a64422daf6820061b0e0818c3a6fd6f9e2025185286785dd18de6b703e4\", \"cf9ddb0e0eb0843ac7e7053a63209ce1c4938f37b058728d408d8ee82cfb5aee\", \"7d4f79ab9f68db66405348ef5b0d3c483e0d5ba475ccc70d53dcc180394fbf9c\", \"55050a51cddb162e3cbdec62a35669a505fe6e16d8b8af406acc8c76d551f8b3\", \"41f162cbe883a382087065b7cf3aacb16ed9277354501cad18220a3790404411\")",
